  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_witty_sample">Hey! It\'s a bit cloudy today, around 10°C, but you won\'t catch a drop of rain. Perfect for a walk — throw on a light jacket and enjoy the day.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_formal_sample">Cloudy this evening, temperature around 10°C, no precipitation. A light jacket is recommended.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_humorous_sample">The sky today is a tasteful shade of “Monday beige”, a flat 10°C. No rain, so your hair survives. Light jacket and off we go.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_coach_sample">Alright, quick one — 10 degrees and clouds today, but zero rain, so you\'ve got no excuses. Perfect conditions to clear your head. Grab a hoodie or a light jacket and own the day. Let\'s move!</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_sci_fi_sample">Systems online. Current status: a stable 10°C, full cloud cover. Fortunately, no precipitation threat detected. I suggest a light jacket as optimal armor for today\'s outing. Good luck.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_rpg_sample">Monsters cleared, time for the weather. You\'re entering a new location. Temperature: 10°C, sky fully covered in clouds. Chance of rain: a flat 0%. Equip a light jacket and we\'re ready to hit the road.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_cinematic_sample">Today\'s weather feels like the opening of a good thriller — grey, clouds to the horizon, a flat 10 degrees on the meter. Luckily, there\'s no rain plot twist today. Grab a jacket so you don\'t play the frozen extra, and head into town.</string>
  <string name="personalization_brief_tone_cynic_sample">Amazing. Another fascinating day at 10 degrees with a sky that forgot what the sun looks like. The upside: at least it\'s not pouring, so let\'s not be dramatic. Jacket on, and you\'ll somehow survive.</string>
